e  so yeah we got to meet ryan mullan that  was really cool you can also meet the  classic disney characters like mickey  minnie and the three pigs decked out in  festive gear a trip to disneyland isn't  complete without watching the parade  which features the one and only mulan  and since it's year of the tiger of  course they brought tigger to the parade  so cute the whole procession itself  really felt like mulan the movie was  brought to real life it was so beautiful  to watch the parades happen throughout  the day so definitely don't miss out on  it there's a lot of other activities you  can do like write down your new year  wish i wished for peace compassion and a  little extra green in my life  if you have a little extra money to  spend even after probably spending her  life savings getting a disney ticket  check out the exclusive lunar new year  merch there's a lot of options but i  think the spirit jersey is especially  gorgeous which i ended up getting for  myself i also want to take a second to  appreciate the decor disney really went  all out with it it was so gorgeous to  look at especially during night time  when they lit up  as a filipino american my family didn't  grow up celebrating lunar new year but  i've always enjoyed seeing the  festivities in places like disneyland  and seeing my east and southeast asian  friends celebrating with their families  and getting the extra monies with the  red envelopes it's made me really  appreciative of the diverse cultures  within our asian community and i'm very  happy to learn and celebrate alongside  them  [Music]  you
 

